    <briefdescription>
<para>A SystemZ-specific constant pool value. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>At present, the only defined constant pool values are module IDs or offsets of thread-local variables (written x@TLSGD, x@TLSLDM, x@DTPOFF, or x@NTPOFF). </para>
    </detaileddescription>
